--TEST--
a property renamed to a name its class already declares is refused, and no alias is written to resolve the clash, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User
{
    public string $na<|>me = "";
    public string $email = "";
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->name;
--REQUEST--
rename to=email
--EXPECT--
refused: `User` already has a property named `$email`.
